  "bio": "Jonathan Inkley is a highly skilled tattoo artist with a distinct mastery in traditional and illustrative styles. Operating out of Born Again Tattoo in Columbia, SC, his professionalism is evident in both his meticulous work and the sterile, immaculate condition of his studio, ensuring a safe and exceptional tattooing experience for all his clients. Contact Jonathan at (803) 636-1627 to bring your ink visions to life with confidence.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\n@devinestreettattoo Devine street tattoo.              Columbia, sc  text for appointments.                      (803) 881-6147. Say hello\n\n@devinestreettattoo Devine street tattoo.              Columbia, sc  text for appointments.                      (803) 881-6147. Say hello",
